sing settles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the nearest state with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at its base scale,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centered on the magenta artboard."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}